  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Given a container containing a child:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "c1 --> c2",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If you delete c2 and then create version v0 of c1, when you look at the contents of c1/fcr:versions/v0 you will see it listing c2 as a child of the version, and c2 will have the same contents it had before it was deleted even though it was deleted before creating the version.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If you delete c1/c2/fcr:tombstone and create version v1 of c1, then v1 will not list c2 as a child. So it appears that if you don't clean up the tombstone fedora will restore deleted children when creating a snapshot.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It can be replicated as follows (tested in 4.7.5 and 4.7.3)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -XPUT http://localhost:8080/rest/c1\r\ncurl -XPUT http://localhost:8080/rest/c1/c2\r\n\r\ncurl -XDELETE http://localhost:8080/rest/c1/c2\r\n\r\ncurl -XPOST http://localhost:8080/rest/c1/fcr:versions -H\"Slug: v0\"\r\n\r\ncurl http://localhost:8080/rest/c1/fcr:versions/v0/c2\r\n# Status: 200\r\n# <http://localhost:8080/rest/c1/fcr:versions/v0/c2>\r\n#         rdf:type          fedora:Version ;\r\n#         fedora:createdBy  \"bypassAdmin\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> ;\r\n#         fedora:created    \"2019-02-08T21:05:24.907Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;\r\n#         rdf:type          ldp:RDFSource ;\r\n#         rdf:type          ldp:Container ;\r\n#         rdf:type          ldp:BasicContainer ;\r\n#         fedora:writable   \"true\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean> ;\r\n#         fedora:hasParent  <http://localhost:8080/rest/c1/fcr:versions/v0> .\r\n\r\ncurl http://localhost:8080/rest/c1/c2\r\n# Status: 410\r\n\r\ncurl -XDELETE http://localhost:8080/rest/c1/c2/fcr:tombstone\r\n\r\ncurl -XPOST http://localhost:8080/rest/c1/fcr:versions -H\"Slug: v1\"\r\n\r\ncurl http://localhost:8080/rest/c1/fcr:versions/v1/c2\r\n# Status: 400\r\n# Prefix fcr has not been registered\r\n\r\ncurl http://localhost:8080/rest/c1/c2\r\n# Status: 404",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
