  "description": "<p>Given a container containing a child:</p>\n\n<p>c1 --&gt; c2</p>\n\n<p>If you delete c2 and then create version v0 of c1, when you look at the contents of c1/fcr:versions/v0 you will see it listing c2 as a child of the version, and c2 will have the same contents it had before it was deleted even though it was deleted before creating the version.</p>\n\n<p>If you delete c1/c2/fcr:tombstone and create version v1 of c1, then v1 will not list c2 as a child. So it appears that if you don't clean up the tombstone fedora will restore deleted children when creating a snapshot.</p>\n\n<p>It can be replicated as follows (tested in 4.7.5 and 4.7.3)</p>\n\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n\r\ncurl -XPUT http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1\r\n</span>curl -XPUT http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1/c2\r\n</span>\r\ncurl -XDELETE http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1/c2\r\n</span>\r\ncurl -XPOST http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1/fcr:versions -H<span class=\"code-quote\">\"Slug: v0\"</span>\r\n</span>\r\ncurl http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1/fcr:versions/v0/c2\r\n</span># Status: 200\r\n# &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1/fcr:versions/v0/c2&gt;\r\n</span>#         rdf:type          fedora:Version ;\r\n#         fedora:createdBy  <span class=\"code-quote\">\"bypassAdmin\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string&gt; ;\r\n</span>#         fedora:created    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"2019-02-08T21:05:24.907Z\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;\r\n</span>#         rdf:type          ldp:RDFSource ;\r\n#         rdf:type          ldp:Container ;\r\n#         rdf:type          ldp:BasicContainer ;\r\n#         fedora:writable   <span class=\"code-quote\">\"<span class=\"code-keyword\">true</span>\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#<span class=\"code-object\">boolean</span>&gt; ;\r\n</span>#         fedora:hasParent  &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1/fcr:versions/v0&gt; .\r\n</span>\r\ncurl http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1/c2\r\n</span># Status: 410\r\n\r\ncurl -XDELETE http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1/c2/fcr:tombstone\r\n</span>\r\ncurl -XPOST http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1/fcr:versions -H<span class=\"code-quote\">\"Slug: v1\"</span>\r\n</span>\r\ncurl http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1/fcr:versions/v1/c2\r\n</span># Status: 400\r\n# Prefix fcr has not been registered\r\n\r\ncurl http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/c1/c2\r\n</span># Status: 404\r\n\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>",
